WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.604
- Are you a superstitious person?

00:00:01.604 --> 00:00:02.437
I heard this about you.

00:00:02.437 --> 00:00:05.790
- You know, well it
started, it started early

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.860
and actually it has to do with you,

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.913
funny you ask.
- Oh.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.080
- I claimed I was responsible

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.700
for you winning "American Idol."

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.870
- Oh, did you call?

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:16.703
You called in?

00:00:16.703 --> 00:00:17.536
Oh my god, you voted.

00:00:17.536 --> 00:00:18.960
Oh my god.
- Many, many times of course.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:19.793
- Oh, that's awesome.

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:24.360
- No, I was wearing, it
was like a random pink ring

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.630
and I was sure that it had
something to do with you winning,

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.460
I don't know how or why I interpreted it.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.020
- You just kept wearing it every time.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:31.890
- Every time,

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.406
and I was like it's gotta be this ring.

00:00:34.406 --> 00:00:35.700
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.950
And then the next year,
when Ruben Studdard won,

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.158
I was like I'm wearing the ring.

00:00:40.158 --> 00:00:43.410
I'm so powerful.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:44.310
- Did it continue?

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.140
- No. (laughs)

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.490
- Was just lucky for me and Ruben.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:49.770
- Yeah, I think it was just you and Ruben,

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:50.670
not the ring.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.040
But yeah, that ring is no longer,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.230
but I have random other superstitions

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:56.340
that I've developed.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.173
Do you have any?

00:00:57.173 --> 00:00:58.006
- Yes.
- Really?

00:00:58.006 --> 00:00:58.839
- Yes.

00:00:58.839 --> 00:01:03.570
I'm not like, I think mine's more OCD.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:04.740
Yeah.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.270
- Does your brain go to
like if I don't do this

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:07.524
a disaster's gonna happen?

00:01:07.524 --> 00:01:08.357
- Yes.

00:01:08.357 --> 00:01:09.190
- Oh yeah.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:10.023
- Yes.

00:01:10.023 --> 00:01:11.010
Like crazy.
- Me too.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.050
Like if I go down a water slide,

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.820
I'm like, I don't wanna
go down a second time

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.180
but I have to because if I
don't do it a second time

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.710
the world is gonna explode.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.442
- Because I believe in even numbers.

00:01:21.442 --> 00:01:22.275
- Me too!

00:01:22.275 --> 00:01:23.730
- I don't like odd numbers.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:24.563
- Hate.

00:01:24.563 --> 00:01:25.895
- Yeah, so I don't do
anything just once. (laughs)

00:01:25.895 --> 00:01:28.860
- Like shopping, I have to touch fabrics,

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.031
even number of times, so
then people will be like

00:01:30.031 --> 00:01:31.890
"What's she doing in the corner?"

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.847
And I'm like eight, 16.

00:01:33.847 --> 00:01:35.160
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.840
- People are like she's weird.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:37.830
- Is she okay?

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.260
I'm like, I'm great.

